# Search speed (added 2026-11-21): ripgrep, and with it Claude Code's Grep and Glob, skips these folders when it
# searches the whole project. They hold generated renders, frames, logs, temp bundles, installed packages and media.
# A search that names one of these folders as its path still works (e.g. Glob with path studio/out/pointing_v4).
node_modules/
.venv/
__pycache__/
_remotion-tmp*/
studio/out/
studio/backup/
/out/
kit_preview/
lookpilot/
channel_art/
pointing_preview/
study/videos/
study/voices/pool/
sound/*/audio/_cache/
sound/*/audio/_bak*/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
